{"name":"Khalab","status":"ok","title":"Khalab","pageId":55343,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Khalab</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-TH.VI-p64_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VI-p64-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Village</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Murgh%C3%B4m\" title=\"Murghôm\">Murghôm</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Hordelands\" title=\"Hordelands\">Hordelands</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Khalab\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Khalab\">Inhabitants of  Khalab</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Locations in Khalab (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6TG9jYXRpb25zX2luX0toYWxhYj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Locations in  Khalab</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Khalab (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9LaGFsYWI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Organizations in  Khalab</span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Khalab</b> was a small fishing village located in <a href=\"/wiki/Murgh%C3%B4m\" title=\"Murghôm\">Murghôm</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TH.VI-p64_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VI-p64-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Location\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Location</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Notable_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Location\">Location</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Location\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Khalab?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Location\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Khalab sat on the western banks of <a href=\"/wiki/Brightstar_Lake\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Brightstar Lake\">Gbor Nor</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TH.VI-p64_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VI-p64-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Khalab?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Though the village was unremarkable, some considered the long trip to Khalab well worth the effort with the hopes of training under <a href=\"/wiki/Salid_Dhuzma\" title=\"Salid Dhuzma\">Salid Dhuzma</a>, a bard of great renown.<sup id=\"cite_ref-TH.VI-p64_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VI-p64-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Khalab?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Baelzur's Tower (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmFlbHp1ciUyN3NfVG93ZXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Baelzur's Tower</span></li></ul>\